--- !u!114 &2090401431
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2090401430}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 2 | Ders 1 | Oyun Motoru Nedir?"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin ba\u015F\u0131ndaki durumdur. Ad\u0131mlar\u0131 burada
    kendiniz uygulay\u0131n.\n\nTek sat\u0131r kod yazmadan bo\u015F bir Unity projesinin
    haz\u0131r sundu\u011Fu sistemleri say\u0131yoruz. Sahneye bir k\xFCp ve bir
    zemin ekliyor, k\xFCpe fizik veriyor ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131yoruz. K\xFCp
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCyor, zemine \xE7arp\u0131yor ve duruyor. B\xFCt\xFCn bunlar\u0131
    motor yap\u0131yor."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders01_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n. Hierarchy penceresinde Main Camera
    ve Directional Light nesnelerine s\u0131rayla t\u0131klay\u0131n. Bo\u015F sahne
    bile bir kamera ve bir \u0131\u015F\u0131kla gelir."
  - "Scene, Game, Inspector, Project ve Console pencerelerinin yerini bulun. Scene
    d\xFCnyay\u0131 d\xFCzenledi\u011Finiz g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCmd\xFCr, Game ise oyuncunun
    kameradan g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFC g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCd\xFCr."
  - "Hierarchy'de bo\u015F alana sa\u011F t\u0131klay\u0131n, 3D Object men\xFCs\xFCnden
    Cube se\xE7in. Inspector'da k\xFCp\xFCn d\xF6rt bile\u015Fenini inceleyin. Bunlar
    Transform, Mesh Filter, Mesh Renderer ve Box Collider bile\u015Fenleridir."
  - "K\xFCp\xFCn Transform bile\u015Feninde Position Y de\u011Ferini 5 yap\u0131n.
    Ard\u0131ndan 3D Object men\xFCs\xFCnden Plane ekleyin ve Scale de\u011Ferini
    3, 1, 3 olarak ayarlay\u0131n."
  - "K\xFCp\xFC se\xE7in, Add Component d\xFC\u011Fmesine bas\u0131n ve Rigidbody
    ekleyin. Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. K\xFCp d\xFC\u015Fer, zemine \xE7arpar
    ve durur."
  - "Play modundayken Game penceresinin sa\u011F \xFCst\xFCndeki Stats d\xFC\u011Fmesini
    a\xE7\u0131n. FPS, Batches ve Tris de\u011Ferlerini okuyun."
  - "Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n. File men\xFCs\xFCnden Build Profiles penceresini
    a\xE7\u0131n ve platform listesine bak\u0131n."
  kendinDene:
  - "K\xFCp\xFCn Rigidbody bile\u015Feninde Use Gravity kutusunu kapat\u0131n ve
    Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. K\xFCp neden d\xFC\u015Fm\xFCyor?"
  - "Plane nesnesini devre d\u0131\u015F\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n ve Play tu\u015Funa
    bas\u0131n. K\xFCp nereye kadar d\xFC\u015F\xFCyor?"
  - "K\xFCp\xFCn Position Y de\u011Ferini 20 yap\u0131n. D\xFC\u015Fme s\xFCresi
    nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor?"
